{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Excuse me, can I buy a ham sandwich? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Here you are. <br/>", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Thank you. That looks delicious! Can you give me a napkin, please? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:  Sure, here you are. <br/>", "id": 2, "time": "5800", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  Thanks. Where can I find the spicy mustard? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>:  It's on the counter, sir. I can hand that to you.", "id": 3, "time": "15800", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Can I get anything else for you today? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  No. Thanks, again. <br/>", "id": 4, "time": "23800", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Sit. Eat. Enjoy your sandwich! <br/>", "id": 5, "time": "29800", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Can I ask you a question? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: Sure. <br/>", "id": 6, "time": "33800", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  What time does the deli close? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Clerk</span>: The deli closes at 8:00 p.m. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>:  That's great! My wife loves your sandwiches.", "id": 7, "time": "37500", "image": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn1le02ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn1le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [{"content": [], "type": "tips"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Meeting New People", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Let's Get Lunch!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "Beginner", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Handing Something to Someone ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Use these expressions when you hand things to a person.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Expressions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Here you are. <br/>Here you go. <br/>Here it is. <br/>Here they are.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">You</span>: Could you pass me the salt? <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Friend</span>: Here you are. <br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">You</span>: Could you pass me the rice? <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Friend</span>: Here it is. <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> You</span>: Can I have the napkins, please? <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Friend</span>: Here they are.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Simple Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You add an <span class=\"strong\">-s</span>  to the verb when you use the 3rd person singular in  the Present tense.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Singular\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I <br/> He <br/> She <br/> It <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I love sandwiches.<br/> He gets home at 10 p.m. <br/> She doesn't like ham. <br/> Does it close at 8 p.m.?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Plural\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We <br/> You  <br/> They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We love ham sandwiches. <br/> Do you ask questions in class? <br/> They don't  get home at 6 p.m.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to pass ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give a thing to a person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you pass me the butter, please?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to describe actions. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to hand ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to give an object to a person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you hand me the mustard?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "spicy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "hot; flavored with spice", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This pepper is spicy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mustard ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a spicy yellow sauce", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I love mustard in my ham sandwich.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to look ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to appear", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This sandwich looks good!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to close ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to change from open to not open", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The deli closes at 9:00 pm.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "delicious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very pleasing to eat", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This sandwich is delicious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn1le02ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Completes simple dialogues b